Subject: Cantor SJS Commit Envelope Journal P2 Justification

@ [justification_uuid] 4d83561c-9cf3-4b1d-b3c9-7f188fc56437
@ [canonical_uuid] 27ac629d-a885-49f1-85ca-14c52c2f3b0e

& [Why]
  + P1 closes physical staged inventory but same-payload ChangeSetManifest custody is recursively digest-dependent
  + weakening exact coverage would invalidate the reason the P0 graph verifier exists
  + one-head-lag successor custody makes the time dimension explicit and leaves one honest open tip instead of claiming impossible self-closure

& [WhyNow]
  + this is the smallest dependency-correct seam before SWA-05 can consume P1 and P0 safely

& [WhyPure]
  + protocol semantics must be proved independently before physical commit-tree observation or mutation authority is considered
